# POST /batch on the job-facing read listener: golden fixture of framing v1.
#
# A client test can replay it: each `case` has a request body (JSON, sent with
# `POST /batch`, `Content-Type: application/json`, `Authorization: Bearer <grant>`) and
# either the 200 response body, as hex (one frame per digest in request order: 1 byte
# status, 8 bytes big-endian length, then the bytes; whitespace between frames is only for
# reading), or the refusal of the whole request (`refused <status> <reason>`, the body being
# the reason and a newline).
#
# Status bytes: 00 ok, 01 not_found, 02 out_of_scope, 03 too_large (one blob over 4194304
# bytes, use GET), 04 store_unavailable. The length is the blob's size when ok, else 0.
#
# The world: an Action whose input tree holds every blob below but the `outside` one.
#   blob <name> <class> <content as hex>   in-scope: held and readable; absent: in scope,
#                                          not held; outside: held, not in scope; fails: in
#                                          scope, held, and the store fails when it is read
#   sized <name> <sha256 hex> <size>       in scope, held by no one (for sizes only)
# The test checks every `request` against the digests of the blobs it names.

# alpha = 8ed3f6ad685b959ead7022518e1af76cd816f8e8ec7ccdda1ed4018e8f2223f8/5
# beta = f947eb43d2a14729a8f564f8bec96876da19350e88f62674f8c644f67ee1a922/23
# empty = e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855/0
# gone = 283bb9deef02e6843abfb538efa1eca70801bd8a701c3f98191e123496339247/4
# secret = 618ee6d4bf4c8f7b72bb15e86fac48abbb3558a4889d5a3cb8c51c75e124df43/22
# flaky = bdbb9deb8e394404f4c85bcd0c3f0f0ccacb8947febb8dfdb961fb11224a9f67/5
# huge = 5e580eee1a39851ef636172a5b2939d4a51eeeeaa62dd4e01128d5ab0dc008ea/5242880
# big_a = 825ec27969966d8f88e76c3b0018ce15963275eceeda0adb1778d80f9a09e762/3145728
# big_b = 005bcc1d79262bf7b72ac6a274e134584dba11e21d735f81e8eb07d5ae63c79e/3145728
# half_a = 59a1cc713c06a4242565184136f55f54b16fc31a505d9c3390918ff861000ac0/2097152
# half_b = e8d8c6a6cb9c03e702c63e27dff0758e745ed314adbff3b3317969d46e34d525/2097152

blob alpha in-scope 616c706861
blob beta in-scope 626574612c20696e2061207375626469726563746f7279
blob empty in-scope
blob gone absent 676f6e65
blob secret outside 616e6f746865722074656e616e742773206279746573
blob flaky fails 666c616b79
sized huge 5e580eee1a39851ef636172a5b2939d4a51eeeeaa62dd4e01128d5ab0dc008ea 5242880
sized big_a 825ec27969966d8f88e76c3b0018ce15963275eceeda0adb1778d80f9a09e762 3145728
sized big_b 005bcc1d79262bf7b72ac6a274e134584dba11e21d735f81e8eb07d5ae63c79e 3145728
sized half_a 59a1cc713c06a4242565184136f55f54b16fc31a505d9c3390918ff861000ac0 2097152
sized half_b e8d8c6a6cb9c03e702c63e27dff0758e745ed314adbff3b3317969d46e34d525 2097152

case duplicates_are_answered_each_time_in_request_order
